  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 916ca174c9f91bc47ab29cda8fbdcf0b, type: 3}
  m_Name: Memory_Mug
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::MemoryData
  openingLine: This reminds me of...
  lines:
  - Dad drank out of this mug every single morning. Black coffee, way too strong.
  - On Saturdays he made pancakes and sang off-key the whole time.
  - "Then he\u2019d lean in to kiss my forehead, and his breath smelled SO bad."
  - "I\u2019d scream and push him away, and he\u2019d just laugh and do it again."
  - I used to despise his coffee breath. I always told him to go brush his teeth,
    he never did.
  - "I\u2019d give anything right now to smell it one more time."
